{"headword":"מָרָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. be contentious, refractory, rebellious (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Hiph.; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مَرَىَ</span> iii. <em>dispute with;</em> Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܰܪܺܝ</span> Pa. <em>contend with</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.26\">1 K 13:26</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָֽרְתָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 14:1\" href=\"/Hosea.14.1\">Ho 14:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מָרָ֑תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.17\">Je 4:17</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָרִיתָ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.21\">1 K 13:21</a> + 11 times pf.; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:20\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.20\">La 1:20</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.26\">2 K 14:26</a> (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">מר</span>, √ <span dir=\"rtl\">מרר</span>, Kmp<sup> Kau</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי מַר הוּא</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.18\">Dt 21:18</a> + 3 times; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹרְאָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:1\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.1\">Zp 3:1</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹרָה</span>; metapl. form according to Ges<sup>§ 75 R. 22</sup>); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:10\" href=\"/Numbers.20.10\">Nu 20:10</a>;—<em>be disobedient, rebellious:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּן סוֹרֵר וּמֹרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.18\">Dt 21:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.20\">20</a> <em>stubborn and rebellious son</em> (towards father)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"elsewhere towards God: <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּר סוֹרֵר וּמֹרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:8\" href=\"/Psalms.78.8\">ψ 78:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵב סורר ומ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.23\">Je 5:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹרְאָה ונגאלה הָעִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:1\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.1\">Zp 3:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמֹּרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:10\" href=\"/Numbers.20.10\">Nu 20:10</a> <em>ye rebels</em> (P); abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.5\">Is 50:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 63:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.63.10\">63:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:20\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.20\">La 1:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מאן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.20\">Is 1:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פשׁע</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:42\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.42\">La 3:42</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 14:1\" href=\"/Hosea.14.1\">Ho 14:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:11\" href=\"/Psalms.5.11\">ψ 5:11</a>, elsewhere acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.17\">Je 4:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s words <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:28\" href=\"/Psalms.105.28\">ψ 105:28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פי (את) מרה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:24\" href=\"/Numbers.20.24\">Nu 20:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:14\" href=\"/Numbers.27.14\">27:14</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.15\">1 S 12:15</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.21\">1 K 13:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.26\">26</a> (D<sup>2</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:18\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.18\">La 1:18</a>.—In <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:4\" href=\"/Hosea.4.4\">Ho 4:4</a> read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">מָרוּ בִי</span> <em>have rebelled against me</em> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּמְרִיבֵי</span>), so RS<sup>Proph. iv. n. 8</sup> Che (for other views v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רִיב\" href=\"/BDB,_רִיב\", dir=\"rtl\">ריב</a>)."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִמְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:33\" href=\"/Psalms.106.33\">ψ 106:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:11\" href=\"/Psalms.107.11\">107:11</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַמְרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:18\" href=\"/Joshua.1.18\">Jos 1:18</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתֶּ֫מֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.6\">Ez 5:6</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּמֵּר</span> (as if √ <span dir=\"rtl\">מרר</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:21\" href=\"/Exodus.23.21\">Ex 23:21</a>, read <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּ֫מֶר</span> Di al.; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַמְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:43\" href=\"/Psalms.106.43\">ψ 106:43</a> + 6 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַמְרוּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:40\" href=\"/Psalms.78.40\">ψ 78:40</a>; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּמְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.14\">1 S 12:14</a> + 3 times; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַמְרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.8\">Is 3:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:17\" href=\"/Psalms.78.17\">ψ 78:17</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּרוֹתָם</span> (Ges<sup>§ 20. 2 b</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Job 17:2\" href=\"/Job.17.2\">Jb 17:2</a>; Pt. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַמְרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.7\">Dt 9:7</a> + 2 times;—<em>shew disobedience, rebelliousness</em>, always toward God: abs. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.26\">Ne 9:26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מרד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:7\" href=\"/Psalms.106.7\">ψ 106:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:43\" href=\"/Psalms.106.43\">43</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 17:2\" href=\"/Job.17.2\">Jb 17:2</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:21\" href=\"/Exodus.23.21\">Ex 23:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.8\">Ez 20:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.21\">21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.7\">Dt 9:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.27\">31:27</a>; elsewhere acc. of God or his commands: <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.8\">Is 3:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.6\">Ez 5:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:17\" href=\"/Psalms.78.17\">ψ 78:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:40\" href=\"/Psalms.78.40\">40</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:56\" href=\"/Psalms.78.56\">56</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:11\" href=\"/Psalms.107.11\">107:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">המרה את פי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.26\">Dt 1:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:43\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.43\">43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.23\">9:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:18\" href=\"/Joshua.1.18\">Jos 1:18</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.14\">1 S 12:14</a> (D<sup>2</sup>), <span dir=\"rtl\">את־רוחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:33\" href=\"/Psalms.106.33\">ψ 106:33</a> (cf. Eph 4:30); perhaps <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:20\" href=\"/Psalms.139.20\">139:20</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אָמַר\" href=\"/BDB,_אָמַר\", dir=\"rtl\">אָמַר</a> <strong>1</strong>)."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB05791","strong_numbers":["4784","4785"],"next_hw":"מְרִי","prev_hw":"מֻרְדָּף","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["5286","5288"],"TWOT":["1242"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}